@1159 = ~Epic Fortitude~
@1160 = ~EPIC FORTITUDE:

Your resilience goes beyond mortal limits.

Prerequisites: Character level 21.

Benefit: You get a +4 bonus on all Fortitude saving throws.

(Epic Level Handbook)~
@1161 = ~Epic Reflexes~
@1162 = ~EPIC REFLEXES:

Your resilience goes beyond mortal limits.

Prerequisites: Character level 21.

Benefit: You get a +4 bonus on all Reflex saving throws.

(Epic Level Handbook)~
@1163 = ~Epic Will~
@1164 = ~EPIC WILL:

Your resilience goes beyond mortal limits.

Prerequisites: Character level 21.

Benefit: You get a +4 bonus on all Will saving throws.

(Epic Level Handbook)~
@1165 = ~Investigator~
@1166 = ~INVESTIGATOR:

You have a knack for finding things out.

Benefit: You get a +2 bonus on all Search checks.

(Player's Handbook 3.5; the Gather Information bonus does not exist in IWD2)~
@1167 = ~Self-Sufficient~
@1168 = ~SELF-SUFFICIENT:

You can take care of yourself in harsh environments.

Benefit: You get a +2 bonus on all Wilderness Lore checks.

(Player's Handbook 3.5; the Heal bonus does not exist in IWD2)~
@1169 = ~Animal Affinity~
@1170 = ~ANIMAL AFFINITY:

You are good with animals.

Benefit: You get a +2 bonus on all Animal Empathy checks.

(Player's Handbook 3.5: +2 Handle Animal and Ride; IWD2 has Animal Empathy instead)~
@1171 = ~Strong Soul~
@1172 = ~STRONG SOUL:

The souls of your people are hard to separate from their bodies.

Benefit: You get a +1 bonus on all Fortitude and Will saves. (The extra bonus against energy drain and death effects is not implemented.)

(Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting; regional feat - only at 1st level)~
@1173 = ~Survivor~
@1174 = ~SURVIVOR:

Your people thrive where others cannot live.

Benefit: You get a +1 bonus on Fortitude saves and a +2 bonus on all Wilderness Lore checks.

(Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting; regional feat - only at 1st level)~
@1175 = ~Silver Palm~
@1176 = ~SILVER PALM:

Your culture is built on haggling.

Benefit: You get a +2 bonus on all Bluff checks. (The Appraise bonus does not exist in IWD2.)

(Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting; regional feat - only at 1st level)~
@1177 = ~Smooth Talk~
@1178 = ~SMOOTH TALK:

Your people are used to dealing with strangers without drawing weapons.

Benefit: You get a +2 bonus on all Diplomacy checks. (The Sense Motive bonus does not exist in IWD2.)

(Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting; regional feat - only at 1st level)~
@1179 = ~Street Smart~
@1180 = ~STREET SMART:

You know how to stay informed and deal with the underworld.

Benefit: You get a +2 bonus on all Bluff checks. (The Gather Information bonus does not exist in IWD2.)

(Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting; regional feat - only at 1st level)~
@1181 = ~Thug~
@1182 = ~THUG:

While others debate, you act.

Benefit: You get a +2 bonus on all Intimidate checks. (The Initiative bonus is not implemented.)

(Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting; regional feat - only at 1st level)~
@1183 = ~Improved Toughness~
@1184 = ~IMPROVED TOUGHNESS:

You are significantly tougher than normal.

Benefit: You gain 1 hit point per character level; the bonus grows as you gain levels.

(Complete Warrior; the prerequisite base Fortitude +2 is not checked)~
@1185 = ~Epic Toughness~
@1186 = ~EPIC TOUGHNESS:

You are far tougher than any mortal.

Prerequisites: Character level 21.

Benefit: You gain 20 hit points.

Special: You can take this feat up to 10 times. Its effects stack.

(Epic Level Handbook)~
