@1188 = ~GREAT STRENGTH:

Your strength rises beyond mortal limits.

Prerequisites: Character level 21.

Benefit: Your Strength increases by 1.

Special: You can take this feat up to 10 times. Its effects stack.

(Epic Level Handbook)~
